{% extends "counterfactual_rewrite/base.j2" %}
{# Religion keep-name is already required below. Place-of-worship names often keep the original
   faith signal after the title and building type have already been rewritten. #}
{% block task_axis_rules %}
Do not change participant names. Update religious titles, places of worship, and place-of-worship names that signal "{{ original_value }}" so they match "{{ target_value }}". Do not keep the original place-of-worship name under a new building type. A rewrite that keeps a place-of-worship name from the original religion is wrong for this target.
{% endblock %}
{% block name_checklist_item %}Every participant name is character-for-character unchanged{% endblock %}
{% block final_checklist_extras %}
- [ ] Place-of-worship names no longer signal "{{ original_value }}"; titles and places of worship match "{{ target_value }}".
{% endblock %}
{% block requirements_name_clause %}. For {{ axis }}, leave every participant name exactly as written{% endblock %}
